          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Two conditional award itineraries offer different tradeoffs: a business-cabin option with a shorter overall trip, and an economy option with more time between separate tickets.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J63@2027-01-08T08:36-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T04:15\",\"n\":\"Business-cabin itinerary\",\"v\":\"The business-cabin choice is 84 minutes shorter overall and arrives earlier than the economy alternative.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J18@2027-01-08T11:47-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Economy itinerary\",\"v\":\"This economy option has a longer LAX connection buffer, which gives you more time between the separately booked flights.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Both itineraries combine separate tickets, and protection between them and permission to reposition are unverified. Award seat support and taxes are unknown, and the award quotes are incomplete. The additional cash quotes also have unknown scope. The award leads below provide dates, not full schedules, and their quote scopes are unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-08/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United economy award lead\",\"v\":\"Worth checking if booking through United is an option for you; this is a lead, not a scheduled itinerary.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-08/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska economy award lead\",\"v\":\"Worth checking if booking through Alaska is an option for you; this is a lead, not a scheduled itinerary.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-08T06:05-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash benchmark\",\"v\":\"Cash benchmark — SFO to BKK: USD 452.00 quoted; quote scope is unknown.\"}]}",
